  nightly partner export. It also states field names are part of the contract and that changes go through a versioned
  endpoint. Older shipped iOS builds in particular can't be updated in lockstep with the server.

  So this isn't something I should just do on the "just the field name" scoping — that scoping limits the edit, but it
  doesn't remove the break.

